{"author": null, "category": "instagram", "content": {"constraints": [], "context_unit_ids": ["instagram-posts-2026-09-15-tired-of-i-need-md-a1b2c2f98a:u000001"], "exceptions": [], "goal": null, "kind": "advice", "prerequisites": [], "steps": [], "summary": {"citations": [{"quote": "'I need to think about it...' 'I'm not in a rush - I'll let you know...' 'Now its not a right time...'", "unit_id": "instagram-posts-2026-09-15-tired-of-i-need-md-a1b2c2f98a:u000001"}], "text": "The post lists common objections such as 'I need to think about it,' 'I'm not in a rush,' and 'Now is not the right time.'"}, "title": "Overcoming Sales Objections", "topic": "sales strategies"}, "content_hash": "68b6104142168fac3bf29668de55c0721eb23497e556915d11a82199a1a6fe6f", "external_status": "not_checked", "extraction_scope": "source_excerpt", "id": "instagram-posts-2026-09-15-tired-of-i-need-md-a1b2c2f98a:knowledge:ec41d741fde790f2", "metadata_hash": "a8a074c6007793045ef2b9596e20f3e111e09b3939b1c4c52879a15170667d44", "product": "knowledge", "published_at": "2026-09-15T06:01:15Z", "semantic_status": "not_reviewed", "source_format": "transcript", "source_hash": "8daa979308cb6f171d1981e7c77d946ec4680d5baa38c25e931caecf1bc994cc", "source_id": "instagram-posts-2026-09-15-tired-of-i-need-md-a1b2c2f98a", "source_url": "https://www.instagram.com/p/DdTBHAfAmyi/", "title": "Overcoming Sales Objections", "topic": "sales strategies", "topic_slug": "sales-strategies"}
{"author": null, "category": "instagram", "content": {"constraints": [], "context_unit_ids": ["instagram-posts-2026-09-15-tired-of-i-need-md-a1b2c2f98a:u000002", "instagram-posts-2026-09-15-tired-of-i-need-md-a1b2c2f98a:u000003"], "exceptions": [], "goal": null, "kind": "advice", "prerequisites": [], "steps": [], "summary": {"citations": [{"quote": "This is where neuroemotional persuasion comes in. You learn how to ask better questions. So instead of convincing the client, the client starts convincing himself.", "unit_id": "instagram-posts-2026-09-15-tired-of-i-need-md-a1b2c2f98a:u000003"}], "text": "Neuroemotional persuasion involves learning to ask better questions so the client convinces themselves rather than being convinced by the agent."}, "title": "Neuroemotional Persuasion", "topic": "neural persuasion"}, "content_hash": "68b6104142168fac3bf29668de55c0721eb23497e556915d11a82199a1a6fe6f", "external_status": "not_checked", "extraction_scope": "source_excerpt", "id": "instagram-posts-2026-09-15-tired-of-i-need-md-a1b2c2f98a:knowledge:5b9464047208e663", "metadata_hash": "a8a074c6007793045ef2b9596e20f3e111e09b3939b1c4c52879a15170667d44", "product": "knowledge", "published_at": "2026-09-15T06:01:15Z", "semantic_status": "not_reviewed", "source_format": "transcript", "source_hash": "8daa979308cb6f171d1981e7c77d946ec4680d5baa38c25e931caecf1bc994cc", "source_id": "instagram-posts-2026-09-15-tired-of-i-need-md-a1b2c2f98a", "source_url": "https://www.instagram.com/p/DdTBHAfAmyi/", "title": "Neuroemotional Persuasion", "topic": "neural persuasion", "topic_slug": "neural-persuasion"}
{"author": null, "category": "instagram", "content": {"context_unit_ids": ["instagram-posts-2026-09-15-tired-of-i-need-md-a1b2c2f98a:u000002", "instagram-posts-2026-09-15-tired-of-i-need-md-a1b2c2f98a:u000003"], "form": "structure", "observation": {"citations": [{"quote": "Most agents try to close by pushing harder. They explain more, they send more options, more payment plans, more follow-ups, and the client still disappears.", "unit_id": "instagram-posts-2026-09-15-tired-of-i-need-md-a1b2c2f98a:u000002"}, {"quote": "This is where neuroemotional persuasion comes in. You learn how to ask better questions.", "unit_id": "instagram-posts-2026-09-15-tired-of-i-need-md-a1b2c2f98a:u000003"}], "text": "The speaker presents common ineffective sales tactics before introducing an alternative method, neuroemotional persuasion. They first list what most agents do wrong, and then explain the concept's fundamentals."}, "purpose": null, "speaker_id": "1", "title": "Sales Advice Framing", "topic": "neural persuasion"}, "content_hash": "68b6104142168fac3bf29668de55c0721eb23497e556915d11a82199a1a6fe6f", "external_status": "not_checked", "extraction_scope": "source_excerpt", "id": "instagram-posts-2026-09-15-tired-of-i-need-md-a1b2c2f98a:expression:0f44b5f5741a4d7c", "metadata_hash": "a8a074c6007793045ef2b9596e20f3e111e09b3939b1c4c52879a15170667d44", "product": "expression", "published_at": "2026-09-15T06:01:15Z", "semantic_status": "not_reviewed", "source_format": "transcript", "source_hash": "8daa979308cb6f171d1981e7c77d946ec4680d5baa38c25e931caecf1bc994cc", "source_id": "instagram-posts-2026-09-15-tired-of-i-need-md-a1b2c2f98a", "source_url": "https://www.instagram.com/p/DdTBHAfAmyi/", "title": "Sales Advice Framing", "topic": "neural persuasion", "topic_slug": "neural-persuasion"}
